birendras. bir. bikram. noi noltrunau .e la .aicuarias noi noltruni'u .e 
drata se lanzu cu te facki le za'i morsi .ije la dipendras. noi seltrucerda 
cu tolsanji". How much should I give as an example? Since in this sentence it 
